  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Pattern: Xを{仕舞|しま}う.\n\nNOTE: This entry is for the main verb {仕舞|しま}う meaning \"to put away.\" For the auxiliary verb ～てしまう, see the separate entry.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ～を{仕舞|しま}う (to put ~ away)\n- {引|ひ}き{出|だ}しに{仕舞|しま}う (to put in a drawer)\n- {店|みせ}を{仕舞|しま}う (to close shop)\n\nWRITING NOTE:\nOften written in hiragana (しまう) rather than kanji ({仕舞|しま}う).\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {仕舞|しま}う: to put away (focus on tidying)\n- {片付|かたづ}ける: to tidy up (broader meaning)\n- {収納|しゅうのう}する: to store (formal)",
